{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/bateshkaaa/status/2079218516150862086","id":"2079218516150862086","text":"","raw_text":{"text":"https://t.co/FCMzr9satN","display_text_range":[0,23],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"bateshkaaa","url":"https://x.com/bateshkaaa","id":"1519662390","followers":851,"following":382,"likes":633,"media_count":39,"name":"Romario","description":"AI believer","raw_description":{"text":"AI believer","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1519662390/1784026096","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1528314063054323714/sI8KPl43_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sat Jun 15 15:30:51 +0000 2013","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":2,"retweets":23,"likes":180,"bookmarks":595,"quotes":9,"created_at":"Mon Jul 20 14:54:58 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1784559298,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":253511,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":null,"replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"source":"Twitter Web App","article":{"created_at":"2026-07-20T14:54:58.000Z","modified_at":"2026-07-20T14:54:58.000Z","id":"2079213481534898176","title":"Build Agency-Quality $10K Websites With Claude Code","preview_text":"Agencies charge $8,000–$12,000 for a marketing site. 3 weeks of calls. 2 rounds of revisions. 1 invoice that makes you sit down.\nClaude Code builds the same site in 1 afternoon. Most people still get","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHNrZ18UXIAAKAAIAAAAAWpQ1NgAA","media_id":"2079213698732728320","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":77.04,"rgb":{"blue":236,"green":245,"red":249}},{"percentage":13.86,"rgb":{"blue":49,"green":50,"red":51}},{"percentage":5.9,"rgb":{"blue":109,"green":112,"red":113}},{"percentage":5.56,"rgb":{"blue":118,"green":119,"red":119}}]},"original_img_height":793,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNrZ18UXIAAe_r2.jpg","original_img_width":1983},"media_key":"3_2079213698732728320"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cai85","text":"Agencies charge $8,000–$12,000 for a marketing site. 3 weeks of calls. 2 rounds of revisions. 1 invoice that makes you sit down.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"egbih","text":"Claude Code builds the same site in 1 afternoon. Most people still get template-looking output. Here's why - and the exact fix.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7v0rk","text":"The standard approach fails because people type \"build me a beautiful website\" and pray. Claude defaults to safe: Inter font, purple gradients, 3 feature cards. This is an amateurish website, and you’ll get almost nothing in return. The $10K look comes from constraints, not vibes.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"840ji","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":43,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"8ag0o","text":"Part 1 - Load the design brain (15 minutes)","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":8,"offset":138}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c82qp","text":"Claude's default taste is a $500 template: Inter font, purple gradient, 3 feature cards. Skills fix that. A skill is just a folder with a SKILL.md file that Claude reads before designing.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"blgmb","text":"Install Claude Code first:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"mentions":[{"fromIndex":40,"text":"anthropic","toIndex":50}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b21mn","text":"Open your terminal, run: npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c4d0s","text":"Run: claude - log in with your account.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6nh8u","text":"Now add the 2 skills:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8rqk5","text":"Go to the anthropics/skills repo on GitHub and download the frontend-design folder.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8toe7","text":"Grab a UI/UX ruleset skill (ui-ux-pro-max is the popular one, also on GitHub).","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3gtjd","text":"Create a folder in your project: .claude/skills/","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6tcle","text":"Drop both skill folders inside. Structure looks like: .claude/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b5i9q","text":"Restart Claude Code. Type /skills or just ask \"what skills do you have\" - both should show up.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":27,"offset":76,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"74ro3","text":"Or just ask Cloud to download these skills—simply send them a link to them.\nPaste this into Claude Code","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6eun3","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"976dg","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6mdt5","text":"That's it. No API, no config. Claude now checks these rules before every design decision.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":4,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"es9gb","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2pcks","text":"Part 2 - Steal the direction (20 minutes)","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6m3e","text":"Adjectives don't work. \"Make it premium\" produces nothing. Screenshots work.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":5,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"aid94","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"757c9","text":"Open Awwwards and Dribbble. Search your niche: \"SaaS landing\", \"portfolio\", \"law firm\".","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8bsco","text":"Pick 3 sites. Not 10 - 3. More references confuse the model.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"63ja7","text":"Screenshot the hero section, 1 content section, and the footer of each. 9 screenshots total.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4rv4e","text":"Save them into your project folder as ref-1.png, ref-2.png, ref-3.png.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"brkuc","text":"In Claude Code, drag the files in or reference them by path with this exact line: \"Match the typography scale, spacing rhythm, and motion of these references. Do not copy the layouts.\"","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":6,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"47qm","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fmaud","text":"The \"do not copy\" part matters. Without it Claude clones reference 1 and you get a lawsuit-adjacent lookalike.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":7,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5rmtf","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a2fq8","text":"Part 3 - The build prompt (5 minutes to write, 6 minutes to run)","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c4dvp","text":"One prompt, 5 blocks. Fill in the brackets:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3lvn0","text":"Audience: \"This site is for [freelance photographers charging $2K+ per shoot].\"","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"elkd8","text":"The 1 action: \"Every page pushes toward [booking a call]. One CTA, repeated.\"","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cdsnc","text":"References: \"Use ref-1.png, ref-2.png, ref-3.png as the quality bar.\"","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1ugnc","text":"Stack: \"Astro, Tailwind, deployed to Cloudflare Pages. Static, fast, no CMS.\"","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"188uh","text":"Ban list: \"Banned: purple gradients, emoji as icons, Inter as the display font, generic stock-photo placeholders, centered-everything layouts.\"","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"i7cu","text":"Paste all 5 blocks as 1 message. First working version lands in 4–6 minutes. ","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":8,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9edmh","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"afia3","text":"It will be 70% there. That's expected — nobody ships version 1. ","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":9,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"80ukc","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9gnpj","text":"After Part 3, you'll have the first version of the website","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":10,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9veon","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9tio5","text":"Part 4 - The polish pass (1–2 hours, this is the $10K part)","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fbcat","text":"Agencies bill 40% of the project for this stage. Run 3 passes, in order, as 3 separate messages:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"942l8","text":"Pass 1 — typography only: \"Review every heading and body size. Establish a strict type scale. Fix line-height and letter-spacing. Touch nothing else.\"","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3os0q","text":"Pass 2 — spacing only: \"Audit vertical rhythm section by section. Double the whitespace where sections feel cramped. Touch nothing else.\"","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7ogte","text":"Pass 3 — motion only: \"Add scroll-reveal and hover states. Subtle. 200–300ms. Nothing bounces.\"","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"122t6","text":"Why separate: ask for all 3 at once and Claude fixes 1 dimension well and 2 badly.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7qbk","text":"Then the mobile check: \"Show me every page at 375px width and fix what breaks.\" 60%+ of your traffic is a phone. Agencies check this last too — they just don't tell you.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":11,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"60b86","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4vdp8","text":"If there's anything you don't like, ask Cloud to fix it.\nJust attach a screenshot and describe what you'd like to see.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3qsli","text":"Life Hack: To add animations to your website, you can simply send a reference site and ask them to create something similar.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":12,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4a7hv","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ehv08","text":"Part 5 - Ship it (15 minutes, $0/month)","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"folk1","text":"Run: git init, commit, push to a new GitHub repo. Claude Code does this for you if you ask.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"h5gt","text":"Go to Cloudflare Pages → Create project → connect the repo.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"co8tm","text":"Build command: npm run build. Output directory: dist. Deploy.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ej22m","text":"Add your domain in the Cloudflare dashboard - DNS propagates in minutes.","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"brkf4","text":"Live site. Free hosting. The agency charges $150/month to babysit the same thing.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":13,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8mvkj","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"31i3p","text":"Realistic progression: site 1 takes 6 hours and looks like $3K\nSite 3 takes 3 hours and looks like $7K\nBy site 5 you have a 2-hour pipeline and a portfolio that closes clients at agency prices.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"28k71","text":"The agency sells 3 weeks of process.\nThe process was always 1 afternoon.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":7,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"3vhm3","text":"RESULT:","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":14,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6psdi","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f97ub","text":"You'll end up with a solid website - not a perfect one.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9jdgg","text":"The first version will always have rough edges. Maybe the mobile layout needs work. Maybe an animation feels off.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eu42q","text":"That's the process.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"843np","text":"Ship it. Find one thing to improve each day. Repeat.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7bq4t","text":"That's how good websites become great ones.","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"12","value":{"data":{},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"DIVIDER"}},{"key":"8","value":{"data":{"markdown":"```\n1. Audience: \"This site is for freelance photographers charging $2K+ per shoot.\"\n2. The 1 action: \"Every page pushes toward booking a call. One CTA, repeated.\"\n3. References: \"Use ref-1.png, ref-2.png, ref-3.png as the quality bar.\"\n4. Stack: \"Astro, Tailwind, deployed to Cloudflare Pages. Static, fast, no CMS.\"\n5. Ban list: \"Banned: purple gradients, emoji as icons, Inter as the display font, generic stock-photo placeholders, centered-everything layouts.\"\n```"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":"MARKDOWN"}},{"key":"4","value":{"data":{},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"DIVIDER"}},{"key":"11","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"48a85e4e-babc-4329-be75-325cbe8aa958","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"8","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2079217021208662016"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"9","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"6c8a37c0-a093-472c-a05c-26fe11c7b45c","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"6","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2079216126500675584"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"13","value":{"data":{},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"DIVIDER"}},{"key":"5","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"08778bb